family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gewicht: 31,9 kg</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Inhalt: 4,5 ltr.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Farbe: weiß</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Befestigungssatz</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Einschl. folgendem Zubehör:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Schallschutzset</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Anschlussstutzen </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Spülstutzen </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Befestigungsmaterial </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Gumminippel 2x</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">einschl. kompletter Befestigung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">angeb. Fabr.:		 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.........