ily:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Anschlussbogen 90G aus PP, D 40 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Winkelschlauchtülle aus PP, D 19 / 23 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Manschette aus EPDM</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Befestigungsmaterial</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Blindkappe für Anschluss G 1&#x22;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">angeb. Fabr.:	 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.........&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Typ:			 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.........&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail/></TextComplement></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Geruchsverschluss AP für Geräte, mit Abdeckung</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Remark ID="id10618"><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bodenabläufe/ Rinnen</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bodenabläufe/ Rinnen</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Remark><Item ID="id10620" RNoPart="47"><Qty>5.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Edelstahl-Entwässerungsrinne B156 L4600 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">V4A Duschrinnen incl. V4A Lochrostabdeckung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Werkstoff 1.4404</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Breite: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> 156 mm zzgl. umlaufendem Andichtflansch</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Länge: 4600 mm zzgl. umlaufendem Andichtflansch</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">für Bodenaufbau von max. 6-10cm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">V4A Entwässerungsrinne</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit umlaufendem Andichtflansch</span><br/><span>d. h. Rinnensichtsteg (6 mm umgebörtelt) wird im Lichten mit 15 mm senkrecht nach unten und 50 mm waagrecht nach außen abgekantet umlaufender Andichtflansch mit angepunkteten Mauerankern.</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">umlaufender Andichtflansch welcher zur Aufnahme der Dünnbettabdichtung dient, wird besandet, d. h. beschichtet mit Grundierharz und abgestreut mit Quarzsand 0,3-0,8mm</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Unterseite der Rinne ebenfalls besandet</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rinnensichtsteg umlaufend 6mm umgebörtelt</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rostauflage längsseitig durchgehend eingekantet</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">aus Werkst. 1.4404, Mat. St. 2,0mm, Oberfläche im Tauchbad gebeizt,</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit angepunkteten Mauerankern</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">höhenverstellbaren Justierschrauben aus VA</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">V4A Entwässerungsrinne mit einem eingearbeiteten Eigengefälle in Richtung des nach Maß eingeschweißten Ablaufstutzens passend für V4A Bodenablaufunterteile DN70</span><br/><span>Stutzendurchmesser 125mm - Stutzenlänge 150mm</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">lose eingelegte V4A Lochrostabdeckung (150x4600mm)</span><br/><span>mit geprüfter Rutschhemmung (Keuzschliff) - bei Bedarf mehrteilig -</span><br/><span>mit geprüfter rutschhemmender Oberfläche für den Barfußbereich</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Belastungsklasse der Lochrostabdeckung begehbar</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Lippendichtung</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rinnen minimal Höhe z. B. -35mm</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rinnen maximal Höhe z. B. -45mm</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Lochrost aus Werkstoff 1.4404 V4A</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Lochrost verschraubt</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">fix und fertig montiert einschl. Befestigungsmaterial</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Angebot. Fabr.:	 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.....................&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-f