pt;">R30 - R120, nach DIN 4102-11.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">fix und fertig montiert einschl. Befestigungsmaterial</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Angebot. Fabr.:	 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.....................&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Typ	 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.....................&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail/></TextComplement></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Brandschutzelement DN 70</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Remark ID="id2107"><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wassermanagment System</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wassermanagment System</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Remark><Item ID="id2108" RNoPart="53"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Steuerzentrale CNX 64 mit Touch-Display</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">+ CNX Wassermanagement-System Steuerzentrale</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Spannungsversorgung und Steuerung für maximal 64 CNX Armaturen, mit integriertem Touch- Display als zentrale Bedieneinheit. Mit integriertem Webserver, mit Benutzer­anmeldung bedienbar über Internet/ Webbrowser oder lokal über Touchscreen. Datenübertragung per LAN und WLAN, anschlussfertig verdrahtet, Anschlussleitung mit Schukostecker, geeignet für Wandmontage. Großzügige variable Leitungstopologie bis zu 350 m in flexibler Linien-, Stern- oder Baumstruktur.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Einbinden, Verwalten, Bedienen, Abfragen, Einstellen und Überwachen der Gesamtanlage, Gruppen- oder Einzelarmaturen</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Touch-Display: mit menügeführter innovativer Bedienoberf­läche, integrierter Uhr- und Kalenderfunktion</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Touch-Display-Funktionen: Einbinden, Verwalten, Bedienen, Abfragen, Einstellen und Überwachen der Gesamtanlage, Gruppen- oder Einzelarmaturen lokal oder über Internet/ Webbrowser, mit Benutzer­anmeldung, Exportfunktion von Anlagen- und Statusprotokollen</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Exportfunktion von Anlagen- und Statusprotokollen</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wasserlaufzeit: Einstellmöglichkeit für Normalbetrieb, Hygienespülung und thermische Desinfektion</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Hygienespülung: Wahl-, Einstell- und Kombinations­möglichkeit (manuell, benutzungs- und kalenderabhängig)</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">thermische Desinfektion: automatische, variable Durchführung gemäß DVGW W 551, Temperaturprotokollierung im PDF-Format mit optionalen Temperaturfühlern</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Reinigungsabschaltung: manuell oder optional über externen Kontakt</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Betriebs- und Störmeldungen mit Speicherung im PDF-Format</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Spannungsversorgungseinheit: Zulassung nach EN 0950 1 / VDE 0805-1, EN 61000-4-2,3,4,5,6,8,11, EN 61000-3-2,-3</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bestehend aus:</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Stahlgehäuse mit Tür, RAL 7035</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">CNX Controller mit proprietärem robustem BUS-System, LAN-Anschluss sowie WLAN-Antenne, SD-Karte zur lebenslangen Datensicherung</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">potenzialfreie Eingänge für: - Start der thermischen Spülung zur Desinfektion (TD), - Deaktivierung Duschbetrieb - Quittierung Sammelfehlermeldung</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Relais-Ausgänge für - Sammelstörmeldung - Thermische Spülung erfolgreich - Thermische Spülung aktiv</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">komplett betriebsbereit montiert und elektrisch angeschlossen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Angebot. Fabr.:	 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.....................&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Typ:				 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.....................&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail/></TextComplement></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Steuerzentrale CNX 64 mit Touch-Display</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2109" RNoPart="54"><Qty>70.000</Qty><QU>m</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Leitung J-Y(St)Y, 2x2x0,8 mm schwarz - grau,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Kabel wird bauseits verlegt.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Zur elektrischen Verdrahtung der Armaturen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">einschließlich Anklemmarbeiten.</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Leitung J-Y(St)Y, 2x2x0,8 mm schwarz - grau,</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2110" RNoPart="55"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Psch</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">CNX Inbetriebnahme</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Inbetriebnahme der Steuerzentralen und Hygienespülungen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gebäudespezifische Parametrierung und Aufschaltung sämtlicher Armaturen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Hierzu gehören:</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Anklemmarbeiten der Armaturen</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gruppeneinteilung thermische Spülung, Kaltwasserspülung und Hygienespülung</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wasserlaufzeiten Duschbetrieb, Hygienespülung, thermische Spülung</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Betriebszeiten, Auslösezeiten, Auslösefunktionen für Hygienespülung, thermische Spülung</span><br/><span>Softwareinstallation und Systemcheck an betriebsbereiter Anlage</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Einstellung von kundenspezifischen Wünschen</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Datenpunktabgleich mit der MSR. Hierzu ist ein gemeinsamer Termin mit der MSR Firma notwendig.</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Funktionstest von allen Armaturen</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Liefern einer Kabelzugsliste und Pläne für den Elektriker</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Duschsprache gemeinsam mit dem Elektriker vor Ort und Kennzeichnung der Anschlussstellen Elektro</span></p></li></ul></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">CNX Inbetriebnahme</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2111" RNoPart="56"><Qty>17.000</Qty><QU>m</QU><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Silikon mit pilzhemmendem Dichtstoff (sauervernetzend) für Anschlussfugen an Fliesen, Badewannen, Duschen, Waschbecken und Küchenmöbeln etc.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Farbe nach Wahl des Bauherren</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Temperaturbeständig: -40 °C bis +150 °C.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">angeb. Fabr.:	 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.........&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Typ:			 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.........&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail/></TextComplement></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Silikon mit pilzhemmendem Dichtstoff (sauervernetzend) für</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2112" RNoPart="57"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Psch</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Organisation einer Bemusterung sämtlicher Sanitär­gegenstände bei einem Großhändler in der Umgebung von Weingarten</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;font-family:Arial;">einschließlich folgenden Arbeiten:</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/></p><ol><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Organisation und Terminabsprache mit dem Bauherr</span><br/><span/></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Abklärung mit dem Bauherr, was bei der Bemusterung vorgestellt werden soll </span><br/><span/></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Übernahme sämtlicher anfallender Kosten</span><br/><span/></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Durchsprache gemeinsam mit dem Bauherr der Objekte und evtl. Vorstellung von Alternativen</span></p></li></ol></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Organisation einer Bemusterung sämtlicher Sanitärgegenstände</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item></Itemlist></BoQBody></BoQCtgy><BoQCtgy ID="id5612" RNoPart="05"><LblTx><p><span>Enthärtungsanlage</span></p></LblTx><BoQBody><Itemlist><Item ID="id5613" RNoPart="1"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Enthärtungsanlage Parallel</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Anlage entspricht den Vorgaben der DIN 19636 und DIN EN14743. Einzelanlagen sind zur DVGW Prüfung angemeldet.</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Vollautomatisch arbeitende Mehrfach-Anlage mit mengengesteuerter Regenerationsauslösung und Proportionalbesalzung zur Einsparung von Salz und Regenerationswasser. Mit integrierter Verschneide­einrichtung, und einstellbarer Chlorelektrolysezelle zur Desinfektion der Anlage bei jeder Regeneration. </span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Bestehend aus:</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">2 Behälter aus GFK inkl. Harzfüllung Berkoresin mit je 1 elektronischem Steuerventil mit Mikroprozessorsteuerung und integriertem Wasserzähler zur Mengensteuerung, Multi-Color Display mit Statusanzeige. Anzeige des Betriebszustandes, des aktuellen Durchflusses, der Restmenge bis zur nächsten Regeneration. Steuerung inkl. auswertbarem Betriebsdaten-Speicher und Wartungsanzeige.</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Integrierte Hygiene-Funktion durch einstellbare Chlorelektrolysezelle.</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Alle Anlagenteile aus korrosionsbeständigen Materialien</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">2 Anlagengehäuse mit integriertem Solebehälter</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">je 1 gemeinsamer Roh-, Weich- und Abwassersammler</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">1 Härtebestimmungsgerät</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">2 Ventilblöcke mit 4 Schaltstellungen </span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">(Betrieb, Service, Bypass, Absperren) zur direkten Montage am Steuerkopf</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">2 Schlauchsätze zum spannungsfreien Anschluss der Einzelanlagen</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Technische Daten:</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Nennvolumenstrom: 10,4 m³/h</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Volumenstrom min. 1,5 m³/h</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Volumenstrom max. 15,6 m³/h</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Kapazität: 2x98 -dH x m³</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Arbeitsbereich: 2,5 - 6,0 bar</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Druckklasse: PN 8,5</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">zul. Betriebstemperatur: 5 - 25 °C</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">zul. Umgebungstemperatur: 5 - 35 °C</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Anschlüsse: R 2&#x22;</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Breite: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">1110 mm</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Höhe: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">1085 mm</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Tiefe:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> 850 mm</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Elektrischer Anschluss: 230 V 50/60 Hz</span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"/><br/><span/><br/><span/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">einschl. folgendem Zubehör</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Störmeldekontakt zur Weitergabe einer Störmeldung</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fix und fertig aufgestellt und angeschlossen, auch elektrisch angeklemmt, einschl. aller Anschluss- und Übergangsstücke</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Einbringung ebenerdig möglich.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">angeb. Fabr.:	 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.........&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Typ:		 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.........&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail/></TextComplement></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Enthärtungsanlage Parallel</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id5615" RNoPart="2"><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Salzmangelanzeige </span><br/><span>Überwachung des Salzstandes</span><br/><span/><br/><span>Steuergerät mit Signalanzeige und GLT-Anschluss, </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">inkl. Niveau-Messsonde, arbeitend nach dem kapazitiven Messprinzip zur Installation außen am Solebehälter zur berührungslosen Überwachung des Salzstandes im Solebehälter.</span><br/><span/><br/><span>Bestehend aus:</span><br/><span>1 Schaltverstärker mit Netzanschluss 230 V, 50 Hz, mit Signal - LED sowie GLT Kontakt, Schaltverstärker mit programmierbarer Schaltverzögerung.</span><br/><span/><br/><span>1 kapazitiver Sensor mit Anschlusskabel.</span><br/><span/></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fix und fertig montiert und elektrisch angeschlossen.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">angeb. Fabr.:		 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.........&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Typ:			 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.........&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail/></TextComplement></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Salzmangelanzeige</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id5621" RNoPart="3"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Verschneideeinrichtung R 2&#x22;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bestehend aus:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 Verschneidearmatur aus Rotguss mit Absperrventilen für Hartwasser und Weichwasser, Einstellschraube zur Einstellung der gewünschten Resthärte, Armatur arbeitet automatisch über Differenzdruck.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Technische Daten:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Betriebsüberdruck max.: 10 bar</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Betriebstemperatur max.: 90 °C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Anschlüsse: G 2 Innengewinde</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Länge: 130 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fix und fertig montiert </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">angeb.. Fabr.:		 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.........&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Typ:			 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.........&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail/></TextComplement></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Verschneideeinrichtung R 2&#x22;</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id5616" RNoPart="4"><Qty>6.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Regenerationssalz</span><br/><span/><br/><span>Hochwirksames Regenerationssalz in Tablettenform zur Herstellung einer qualitativ hochwertigen Solelösung zur Regeneration von Ionenaustauschern.</span><br/><span/><br/><span>Sack 25 kg.</span><br/><span/></p></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">angeb.. Fabr.:		 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.........&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Typ:			 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.........&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail/></TextComplement></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Regenerationssalz</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id5617" RNoPart="5"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Dosieranlage</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mengenproportionale, über Kontaktwasserzähler gesteuerte Dosieranlage. Zur Dosierung der Härtestabilisierungs- und Korrosionsschutzprodukte Hydrex 3901, 3902, 3903 in Trinkwassersystemen.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bestehend aus:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 digitale Motordosierpumpe mit drehzahlgeregeltem Schrittmotor und Mikroprozessorsteuerung für pulsationsarme, quasi kontinuierliche Dosierung, Ansteuerung durch Kontaktwasserzähler. Anzeige für Leermeldung und Störung, drahtbruchsichere Ausführung, potentialfreier Ausgang für Leermeldung und Eingang für extern &#x22;Aus&#x22;.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 Kontaktwasserzähler mit Reed-Kontakt.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 komplette Sauggarnitur mit Kugelrückschlagventil, Niveauschalter für Leermeldeanzeige mit Voralarm und Trockenlaufschutz, inklusive Kabel und Steckanschluss, komplett mit Schraubdeckel für Transportgebinde.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 Kaltwasserimpfstelle R 1/4&#x22;, aus PVC-hart, für Schlauch 6/4 mm.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Produktmerkmale:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Digitale Dosiertechnik,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Voreingestellte Dosiermenge,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Leer- und Vorleermeldung,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Automatischer Betrieb.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Technische Daten:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Betriebsdruck max.: 8 bar</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Ansaughöhe max.: 1,0 m</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Dauerbelastung: 15,0 m³/h</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">kurzzeitige Höchstbelastung: 30,0 m³/h</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Anschlüsse: R 2&#x22;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Betriebstemperatur max.: 30 -C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Umgebungstemperatur max.: 40 -C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Elektrischer Anschluss: 100-240 V, 50 Hz</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Leistung max.: 60 W</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fix und fertig montiert und elektrisch angeschlossen.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">angeb.. Fabr.:		 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.........&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Typ:			 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.........&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail/></TextComplement></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Dosieranlage Berkodos AM 4-50</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id5618" RNoPart="6"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Auffangbehälter für Chemikalien Größe 60</span><br/><span/><br/><span>zur sicheren Aufbewahrung von Chemikalien, innen und außen glatt, konische Ausführung, Nenninhalt 60 Liter, Material PE.</span><br/><span/><br/><span>Technische Daten:</span><br/><span>Innenmaße (LxBxH): 380 x 380 x 370 mm</span><br/><span>Außenmaße (LxBxH): 480 x 480 x 370 mm</span><br/><span/></p></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">angeb.. Fabr.:		 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.........&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Typ:			 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.........&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail/></TextComplement></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Auffangbehälter für Chemikalien Größe 60</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id5619" RNoPart="7"><Qty>40.000</Qty><QU>kg</QU><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Härtestabilisierungsmittel, Korrosionsschutzmittel</span><br/><span>Hydrex 3901</span><br/><span/><br/><span>Hydrex 3901 ist ein flüssiges Kombinationsprdoukt aus speziellen Alkalisilikaten und</span><br/><span>-phosphaten, das als Härtestabilisator und Korrosionsschutzmittel für Trinkwassersysteme mit sehr weichem bis weichem Wasser. Es entspricht in seiner Zusammensetzung und der von uns empfohlenen Dosierung den Vorschriften der Trinkwasserverordnung (TrinkwV 2011).</span><br/><span>Es wird eingesetzt bei Trinkwasser:</span><br/><span>- Härtebereich: 1 - 2</span><br/><span>- Gesamthärte: &#x3c; 8-dH</span><br/><span>- Summe Erdalkalien: &#x3c; 1,4 mol/m3</span><br/><span>- freiem CO2-Gehalt: &#x3e; 10 mg/L</span><br/><span>Und zur Nachbehandlung von enthärtetem Wasser</span><br/><span/></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Dosierrrate von Hydrex 3901 beträgt 100 ml/m3 Trinkwasser. Die Dosierung ist keimfrei und wird unverdünnt eingesetzt</span><br/><span/><br/><span>Dichte (20-C): 1,17 kg/m3</span><br/><span>pH-Wert: 10,9 der 1%igen Lösung</span><br/><span>PO4-Gehalt: ca. 2,4 %</span><br/><span>SiO2-Gehalt: ca. 13,4 %</span><br/><span/></p></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">angeb. Fabr.:		 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.........&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Typ:			 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.........&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail/></TextComplement></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Härtestabilisierungsmittel, Korrosionsschutzmittel</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id5620" RNoPart="8"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Psch</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Anklemmarbeiten, Inbetriebnahme und Einweisung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Inbetriebnahme der vorstehend beschriebenen Anlage (Enthärtung/Dosierung) und Einweisung des Bauherren durch Werkskundendienst, einschließlich Erstellung Protokoll</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Anklemmarbeiten, Inbetriebnahme und Einweisung</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item></Itemlist></BoQBody></BoQCtgy><BoQCtgy ID="id10510" RNoPart="06"><LblTx><p><span>Frischwasserstation</span></p></LblTx><BoQBody><Itemlist><Item ID="id10511" RNoPart="1"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk.</QU><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Frischwasserstation Qmin: 82 l/m / Qmax: 171 l/min</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Trinkwassererwärmer als Wasser-Wasser-Durchlauf­erhitzer mit Mes- und Steuereinrichtung.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Maße B/H/T: 450/800/315 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gewicht: 37 kg</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bestehend aus:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Hydraulikeinheit mit Edelstahlverroh-</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">rung, Edelstahl-Gegenstrom-Plattenwärme-</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">tauscher (Cu-Lot) mit Handentlüfter,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">drehzahlgeregelter Hocheffizienz-</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Tauscherladepumpe, Vortex-Volumenstrom-</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">sensor.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Auf stabiler Stahlblech-Grundplatte für</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wandbefestigung montiert, mit</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Befestigungsmaterial, zweigeteilter</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">wärmegedämmter Schutz- und Abdeckhaube</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">aus EPP.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Anschlussfertig montiert, verrohrt</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">und geprüft.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Hardware-Ausstattung:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Mikroprozessorregelung mit:</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">5 Analogeingänge für PT1000-   Temperatursensoren mit integriertem Überspannungsschutz,</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 Digitaleingang für Durchflussmessung,</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 PWM-Ausgang für Tauscherladepumpe,</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">4 mechanische 230V-System-Ausgänge,</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 potentialfreier Relaisausgang (Öffner/  Schließer),</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 potentialfreier Relaisausgang   (Schließer).</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Volumenstromsensoren</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Temperatursensoren</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Funktionen:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Funktionsanzeige sämtlicher Aktivitäten</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">am integrierten Display des Kompakt-</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">reglers.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;font-family:Arial;">Frischwassererwärmung</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Frischwasserregelung nach neuronalem</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Netzwerk-Verfahren mit durchfluss- und</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">ladetemperaturabhängiger Drehzahl-</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">anpassung der Tauscherladepumpe.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Temperaturregelung im Zapf- und</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Zirkulationsbetrieb wird im</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Millisekundenbereich eingestellt,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">nachgeregelt und über das Neuronale</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Netzwerk selbstlernend angepasst.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Allgemeine Funktionen:</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Konfigurierbare Schaltfunktion</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Antiblockierfunktion für Pumpen</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Servicemeldefunktion</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Technische Daten - Hydraulik:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Zapfvolumenstrom 60/70: 82 l/min</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Maximalzapfvolumenstrom</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">nach DIN 4708: 171 l/min</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Maximalleistung: 419 kW</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Nennzapfvolumenstrom: 90 l/min</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Nennleistung: 220 kW</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Leistungskennzahl bei Max-ZVS: 105</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">kV-Wert:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- heizwasserseitig: 7,68 m3/h</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- trinkwasserseitig: 7,32 m3/h</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">max. Betriebsdruck</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- heizwasserseitig: 10 bar</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- trinkwasserseitig: 10 bar</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">max. Betriebstemperatur:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- heizwasserseitig: 110 Grad C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Tauscher-Spülanschlüsse: 3/8&#x22; IG</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Anschlüsse zum Speicher: 1&#x22; ÜM</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Anschlüsse Kalt- und Warmwasser: 1&#x22; ÜM</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Technische Daten - Elektrik:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Elektrische Versorgung: 230 V / 50 Hz</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">bauseitige Absicherung: 10 A</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">zul. Umgebungstemperatur: 0 - 40 Grad C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Schutzart: IP 41 DIN 40050</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">elektrische Leistungsaufnahme</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Regler-Standby: &#x3c;5 W</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">maximal: 230 V x 5 A = 1,15 kVA</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">CE nach: EN 60730-1</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Ausgangsbelastung:</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">potentialbehaftet:</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">  230 V AC / 1,5 A</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">  AC-3 300 W</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">potentialfrei:</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">  230 V AC / 5 A</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">  AC-3 185 W</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">  DC-1 30 V / 5 A</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Hocheffizienz-Tauscherladepumpe:</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Leistung: 3 bis 180 W</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Drehzahlregelung: per PWM-Signal</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Energieeffizienzindex EEI: &#x3c; 0,23</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Temperaturfühler:</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Typ: PT 1000</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Kabel: Silikon/Schirm/Silikon</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">temperaturbeständig bis: 200 Grad C</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Länge: 7000 mm</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Querschnitt: 0,14 mm2</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Zubehör:</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Dämmhaube EPP-schwarz</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Störmeldekontakt</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Softwareerweiterung für die vollautomatische Durchführung von thermischen Desinfektionen.</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Schnittstelle ModBus RTU</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fix und fertig aufgestellt und angeschlossen, auch elektrisch angeklemmt einschl. aller Anschluss- und Übergangsstücke</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Angebot. Fabr.:	 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;.....................&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Typ:		 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;..................... &#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail/></TextComplement></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Frischwasserstation Qmin: 82 l/m / Qmax: 171 l/min</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id10512" RNoPart="2"><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>Stk.</QU><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Absperr-Set für Geräte/Module mit Dämmung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">4 x DVGW Kugelhahn IG/AG, 4 x Dämmung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Passend für Frischwassererwärmer</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit Anschlüssen 1&#x22; ÜM.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Kugelhahn:</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">voller Durchgang nach DIN EN 1983</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit ISO-T-Griff</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit DVGW-Zulassung</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wärmedämmschale:</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">schadstofffrei und recyclefähig</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">keine externe Fixierung nötig</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">abnehmbar und wiederverwendbar Kugelhahn:</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Material</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gehäuse: [CW617N verchromt]</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Kugel: [CW617N verchromt]</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Kugeldichtung: [PTFE]</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Griff: [ISO-T Griff PA6]</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Temperaturbereich</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Trinkwasser bis + 65 °C dauernd</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Trinkwasser bis + 95 °C kurzzeitig</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">allgemein -30 °C bis +170 °C</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">ISO- T Griff - 30 °C bis + 150 °C</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Druckstufe</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Trinkwasserinstallation PN10</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DVGW Zulassungen für Trinkwasser</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- nach DIN EN 13828 und W570-1</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Anschlüsse</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- zum FWE: [1&#x22; AG]</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- zur Verrohrung: [1&#x22; IG]</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wärmedämmschale:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Länge: 82 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Farbe: anthrazit</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Ar