="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">(O-Ringe) aus kerbfesten, elastischen,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">alterungsbeständigen Elastomeren, alle</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Innenteile aus heißwasserbeständigem</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Kunststoff entsprechen den W270-</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Richtlinien. Handrad für die Rück-</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">spülung. Komplett mit Verschraubungen,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Nachdruckmanometer und Schlauchtülle.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Technische Daten:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rohranschluss: 1&#x22;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Nennleistung: 6 m3/h</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">untere/obere Maschenweite: 200 µm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:255pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Druckverlust nach Rückspülung: 0,2 bar</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;mar